{"type":"message_start","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read the human's request in /runtime/task/SPEC.md; it may be rough notes rather than a complete draft. Use the spec-template skill to investigate the project and draft or refine /runtime/task/SPEC.md. Preserve existing human intent, constraints, and substantive content; never overwrite it with a blank template. Record unresolved questions rather than inventing requirements. Incorporate previous review feedback. Write the updated SPEC.md to disk. Do not implement code or approve documents. The application workspace is the current working directory supplied by Watts; the package descriptor may live elsewhere. Implement application source, tests, modules, and other project files in the project root and its normal source directories. The task directory holds workflow documents, story logs, review artifacts, and execution evidence only; do not create application code or a separate application module inside it. Quality gates run from the project root, not with a task-directory working directory.\nTask documents are in /runtime/task. Application work belongs in /workspace. Write the requested task outputs to /runtime/task.\nPrevious stage result and feedback:\n{\"step\":\"spec-review\",\"attempt\":1,\"artifacts\":[{\"path\":\"SPEC.md\",\"sha256\":\"7fd14f36e0fba38bacaadd691aeeebdafedca0b3a625aa7f2c0f3eeadcc711c5\"}],\"outcome\":\"rejected\",\"feedback\":\"The user authorizes resolving OQ-1 with the recommended server-held state: one shared in-memory game, page refresh retrieves/resumes the current board, concurrent state changes are serialized, and reset returns an empty board with X to move. Record this as a resolved choice in the assumptions/open-questions section and preserve the existing acceptance criteria, terminal behavior, and bounded local scope. This is a requested clarification, not an implementation failure; do not introduce new features or requirements.\",\"data\":{\"approved_by\":\"Codex\",\"authorized_by\":\"j\"}}"}],"timestamp":1791843907961}}
