pty board with X to move.","newText":"- OQ-1: (resolved) Where should the authoritative game state live, and what should happen after a page refresh or in a second tab?\n  Decision: The Go HTTP server holds a single shared in-memory game. A page refresh or second tab retrieves and resumes the current board. Concurrent requests are serialized so the board does not change between evaluation and placement. Reset clears the board and restores X to move. This resolution is recorded in the Assumptions section above.\n\n  Other options considered: browser-held state (page refresh starts a new game). The server-held approach was chosen because it keeps the board authoritative on the backend where the existing game-rule functions live and avoids a multi-tab isolation contract that this task does not need."}],"path":"/runtime/task/SPEC.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":1118,"output":2506,"cacheRead":11008,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1817,"totalTokens":14632,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1791843920555,"responseId":"gen-1791843920-qqbRwivYSLfomXFdu5Id","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","thinkingLevel":"low"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_2efb7a2e8b28495095fcf20b","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Could not find edits[1] in /runtime/task/SPEC.md. The oldText must match exactly including all whitespace and newlines."}],"details":{},"isError":true,"timestamp":1791843946884},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The oldText for OQ-1 didn't match. Let me re-read the exact text from the file to see what's there.","thinkingSignature":"[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"The oldText for OQ-1 didn't match. Let me re-read the exact text from the file to see what's there.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6f3132c704a24da4aaf77591","name":"read","argume