istake could silently change behavior but cannot touch identities, credentials, or entitlements, and there is no production deployment.\n\n## Review\n\nAn agent drafts this document. The declared spec-review Procedure then requires a human decision — or an explicitly delegated coordinator decision — tied to the reviewed artifact hashes. This v2 draft refines v1 against project evidence (`main.go`, `main_test.go`, `go.mod`, and the team gate scripts); no prior rejection feedback was available in this environment to incorporate. On rejection, this draft is revised in place using the feedback while preserving the original intent. A signature in this document does not approve the workflow."}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1791844258994}}
