{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. Let me also check if there was a previous PLAN.md in the task directory to understand what was rejected.\n\nThe feedback says:\n1. Need a read-only state retrieval endpoint (GET /state) or equivalent, and explain that page load/refresh retrieves the existing board without resetting it. Include tests for retrieval after moves, refresh/second-tab hydration, and unchanged state on failed requests.\n2. Choose one concrete web startup interface and use it consistently: an explicit web mode with loopback default and address override. Remove conflicting web-subcommand versus addr-only alternatives.\n\nLet me also read the risk-tiering skill since the plan requires a recheck.","thinkingSignature":"[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"Now I have a clear picture. Let me also check if there was a previous PLAN.md in the task directory to understand what was rejected.\\n\\nThe feedback says:\\n1. Need a read-only state retrieval endpoint (GET /state) or equivalent, and explain that page load/refresh retrieves the existing board without resetting it. Include tests for retrieval after moves, refresh/second-tab hydration, and unchanged state on failed requests.\\n2. Choose one concrete web startup interface and use it consistently: an explicit web mode with loopback default and address override. Remove conflicting web-subcommand versus addr-only alternatives.\\n\\nLet me also read the risk-tiering skill since the plan requires a recheck.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ac27aed72aa742b19916876d","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/opt/watts/kit/skills/risk-tiering/SKILL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5e40cfeb993b4e6fbf3dc28b","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/inputs/resources/team/.golangci.yml"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":6962,"outpu